CONSTRAINTS (govern all decisions in all sessions):
- No payment gateway in Phase 1. Orders use "Pay on Confirmation" — 
  admin contacts customer via WhatsApp with UPI link.
- No bulk upload, no blog, no international shipping (all Phase 2)
- Products: unstitched fabric sets only, 1–4 units stock per product
- Exchange only (no cash refunds). Exchange window = admin-configurable.
- Shipping: Zone A = Delhi NCR, Zone B = Rest of India. 
  Rates and free-shipping thresholds = admin-configurable.
- One coupon per order, no stacking
- Indian number formatting everywhere: toLocaleString('en-IN')
- All policies snapshot to orders at creation time (immutable)

